finally there's  goose the fuzzy little guys and just  tossed into a scene for a bit of comic  relief between the future head of shield  and a random feline it also happens to  be Carol Danvers pet and it's an alien  goose is a flirt c'n an alien species  that typically resembles terrestrial  cats with a couple of noticeable  exceptions for example they have a huge  array of tentacles that come out of  their mouths and they lay eggs at a  furious rate they also possess human  level intellect as well as pocket  realities of space and time within their  bodies so yeah  not your typical house cat in the comics  Danvers pet was named chewy but the name  has apparently been changed from the  famous movie wing man to another for the  MCU adding yet another nod to some  hardcore nostalgia in the process check  out one of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite MCU heroes are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  you  [Music]
 

